            "action_description": {
              "value": "(attack, emotion, incapacitation, mental)\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nHollow Hush feeds on the emotional unrest of a single creature within 30 feet that's currently affected by an emotion effect. The target must succeed at a 41 Will save or take 5d10 mental damage and be stunned for 1 round. If the target fails its saving throw, Hollow Hush regains the same number of Hit Points and Feed on Emotion does not cost Hollow Hush an action, allowing it to use another action this turn."
